ind of fashion where they all have such  a hard time now getting along and having  vacations together you're hoping it  brings some sense of closure to the  families at the very least  terry bernarda thank you so much  everyone out there thanks for joining us  here on law and crime daily we'll see  you next time as we discuss justice in  america  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

